<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκοπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.33
				</span></i>
			 W. ; <i>excision</i> of ribs, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.11
			</span></i> tit. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mutilation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					110.10
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>chiselling out, erasure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					252.41
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>) ; of an arrow-point from a
			bone, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cutting down, felling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.65.6
				</span></i>
			 (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1121.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκοπαὶ λόφων</span>
			<i>levelling</i> of hills, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.8
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πυλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					42.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>incision, notch, mortise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				65.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				27.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Bel.</u>
				92.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				30.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.83
			</span></i>.</div>
